|translation="Is it a '''tomcat''' or a girl cat?" asked Jean.<br> Sophie not having spoken, Alice turned red and said, laughing:<br> "It's a '''tomcat'''!"<br> "Are you sure?" asked Jean.<br> "Of course," said Alice, "for sure!"}}
